<section class="sec" data-pg="privacy" id="privacy">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sechead">
      <div class="snum">Legal</div>
      <div>
        <h2>Privacy <em>Policy</em></h2>
        <p class="lede">Cario Technology and Cario Connected Apps (Cario Connect) are committed to providing quality services to you, and this policy outlines our ongoing obligations in respect of how we manage your Personal Information.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="legal">
      <div class="updated">Committed to your privacy</div>
      <p>We operate to established international privacy principles governing the way in which we collect, use, disclose, store, secure and dispose of your Personal Information. Where local data protection law applies to you, we comply with the requirements of that jurisdiction. If you would like to understand how we handle data in a specific country or region, please contact us.</p>
      <h3>What is Personal Information and why do we collect it?</h3>
      <p>Personal Information is information or an opinion that identifies an individual. Examples of Personal Information we collect include names, addresses, email addresses, phone numbers and location information.</p>
      <p>This information is obtained in a number of ways, including:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Correspondence, by telephone and by email</li>
        <li>Via our website and our mobile applications</li>
        <li>From your website, from media and publications</li>
        <li>From other publicly available sources</li>
        <li>From cookies</li>
        <li>From third parties</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We do not guarantee website links or the policies of authorized third parties.</p>
      <p>We collect your Personal Information for the primary purpose of providing our services to you, providing information to our clients, and marketing. We may also use your Personal Information for secondary purposes closely related to the primary purpose, in circumstances where you would reasonably expect such use or disclosure. You may unsubscribe from our mailing and marketing lists at any time by contacting us in writing.</p>
      <p>When we collect Personal Information we will, where appropriate and where possible, explain to you why we are collecting the information and how we plan to use it.</p>
      <h3>User privacy</h3>
      <p>Cario Apps (Cario Connect) will in some cases share location information with the Cario applications to enable Cario to provide the contracted services. You can choose not to share information when requested in the app. However, we will be unable to provide the services we are contracted to provide if you choose not to share the relevant information when required.</p>
      <h3>Sensitive information</h3>
      <p>Sensitive information includes information or opinion about such things as an individual's racial or ethnic origin, political opinions, membership of a political association, religious or philosophical beliefs, membership of a trade union or other professional body, criminal record or health information.</p>
      <p>Sensitive information will be used by us only:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>For the primary purpose for which it was obtained</li>
        <li>For a secondary purpose that is directly related to the primary purpose</li>
        <li>With your consent, or where required or authorized by law</li>
      </ul>
      <h3>Third parties</h3>
      <p>Where reasonable and practicable to do so, we will collect your Personal Information only from you. However, in some circumstances we may be provided with information by third parties. In such a case we will take reasonable steps to ensure that you are made aware of the information provided to us by the third party.</p>
      <h3>Disclosure of Personal Information</h3>
      <p>Your Personal Information may be disclosed in a number of circumstances, including the following:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>To third parties where you consent to the use or disclosure</li>
        <li>Where required or authorized by law</li>
      </ul>
      <h3>Security of Personal Information</h3>
      <p>Your Personal Information is stored in a manner that reasonably protects it from misuse and loss, and from unauthorized access, modification or disclosure. Each customer is provisioned a dedicated data and analytics layer, and access within your own organization is governed by role-based permissions that you control.</p>
      <p>When your Personal Information is no longer needed for the purpose for which it was obtained, we will take reasonable steps to destroy or permanently de-identify it. However, most Personal Information is or will be stored in client files which are retained for a minimum period in line with our contractual and legal obligations.</p>
      <h3>Access to your Personal Information</h3>
      <p>You may access the Personal Information we hold about you, and update or correct it, subject to certain exceptions. If you wish to access your Personal Information, please contact us in writing.</p>
      <p>We will not charge any fee for your access request, but may charge an administrative fee for providing a copy of your Personal Information. In order to protect your Personal Information we may require identification from you before releasing the requested information.</p>
      <h3>Maintaining the quality of your Personal Information</h3>
      <p>It is important to us that your Personal Information is up to date. We will take reasonable steps to make sure that your Personal Information is accurate, complete and current. If you find that the information we hold is not up to date or is inaccurate, please advise us as soon as practicable so we can update our records and continue to provide quality services to you.</p>
      <h3>Policy updates</h3>
      <p>This policy may change from time to time and the current version is always available on this website.</p>
      <div class="legalbox">
        <h4>Privacy enquiries and complaints</h4>
        <p>If you have any queries or complaints about this privacy policy, or wish to make a request in relation to your Personal Information, please contact us.</p>
        <p><b>Contact</b> &nbsp;<a href="mailto:sales@cario.com.au?subject=Privacy%20enquiry">sales@cario.com.au</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
